{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"45ea329a-3532-4377-84af-b0abc98a1656","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam UAE Track","slug":"superteamuae-sidetrack-colosseum","description":"\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam UAE Track - Crypto World's Fair\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis track is a local prize pool for UAE teams competing in Colosseum's Crypto World's Fair.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eCrypto World's Fair brings builders from across the world's leading blockchain ecosystems into one open competition. This side track is our way of backing the strongest UAE founders taking part.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project is built on Solana\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThe project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must submit to the Crypto World's Fair hackathon and mark \"UNITED ARAB EMIRATES\" as your country\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003eofficial rules of the global hackathon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThe judging criteria for the Superteam UAE Track will mirror that of the global hackathon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eEcosystem Impact: does the project contribute real value through infrastructure, tooling, or a product people need?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eProduct-Market Fit: is there a clear problem, a defined user, and early signs that the solution works?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eGrowth Potential: can the project attract new users or deepen engagement among existing ones?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRewards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1st place:\u003c/strong\u003e 2,000 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2nd place:\u003c/strong\u003e 1,500 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3rd place:\u003c/strong\u003e 1,000 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBonus prize:\u003c/strong\u003e 500 USDG\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThe bonus prize will recognise one standout project outside the top three that demonstrate exceptional promise, execution or originality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThese prizes are in addition to anything you may win through Crypto World’s Fair, including the \u003cstrong\u003eUS$100,000 Solana ecosystem track\u003c/strong\u003e, general awards and potential consideration for the Colosseum Accelerator.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to enter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eRegister for \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eCrypto World's Fair\u003c/a\u003e and select United Arab Emirates as your location.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eEnter your project in the Solana ecosystem track.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eComplete your official Crypto World's Fair submission by October 12, 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSubmit to this Superteam Earn side track with:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eProject name and a short description\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eNames and locations of your UAE-based team members\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour Crypto World's Fair project or submission link\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eA working product link\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eA public demo video\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project's X account and other relevant socials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eAny traction, users or other evidence of progress\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/BuildersCoffeeColosseumHackathon\"\u003eBuilders Coffee\u003c/a\u003e on September 23. An informal meetup to find a team, pressure test your idea, and meet other builders taking part.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/BuildersStationColosseumHackathon\"\u003eBuilders Station\u003c/a\u003e on October 6. A co-working session for the final stretch of the hackathon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eColosseum submissions close October 12.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eCrypto World's Fair Website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/hackathon\"\u003eSuperteam Hackathon Resources Website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/build\"\u003eSuperteam Build\u003c/a\u003e, if you're looking for ideas to build\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-27T19:59:59.999Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":false,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":false,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit this project to the official Frontier Hackathon on Colosseum? (Yes/No)"},{"type":"link","order":8,"optional":false,"question":"Link to Colosseum project"},{"type":"link","order":9,"optional":false,"question":"